%% Land File Upload Sequence
sequenceDiagram
    title Land File Upload - CharAI Backend

    actor Farmer
    participant Frontend
    participant "Backend API" as API
    participant "GeoData Processor" as Geo
    storage "File Storage" as Storage

    note over Farmer,Geo: User uploads .kml/.geojson file
    Farmer->>Frontend: Upload land file
    Frontend->>API: POST /upload-land (FormData)
    API->>Storage: Store uploaded file
    Storage-->>API: File saved successfully
    API->>Geo: Extract field boundaries
    Geo-->>API: Return GeoJSON data
    API-->>Frontend: Display uploaded area
    Frontend-->>Farmer: View field on map